{"4621560": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "SnakeyBoss", "steam_appid": 4621560, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sergeant Snake is trying to chase you away! Try your best to dodge and get a high score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move with WASD! Your green snake moves forward automatically. You just need to control the direction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you touch the boss's body, the bodies of the snakes summoned by the boss, or the stone pillars summoned by the boss, your body will be severed or you will die.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eat an apple to grow bigger! Your snake's extended tail will help you defeat the purple snakes summoned by the boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push bombs at the boss to earn points! Bombs explode after a certain amount of time, and if you fail to dodge them before then, you will take damage as well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quickly push the bombs at the boss and get out of the way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sergeant Snake is trying to chase you away! Try your best to dodge and get a high score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move with WASD! Your green snake moves forward automatically. You just need to control the direction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you touch the boss's body, the bodies of the snakes summoned by the boss, or the stone pillars summoned by the boss, your body will be severed or you will die.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eat an apple to grow bigger! Your snake's extended tail will help you defeat the purple snakes summoned by the boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push bombs at the boss to earn points! Bombs explode after a certain amount of time, and if you fail to dodge them before then, you will take damage as well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quickly push the bombs at the boss and get out of the way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive!</p>"